* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_ucdyn (reference/crafted.toml, 8 Nov 2026): dynamic user
* constraints in the RHS direction (equserco.mod L80-106, uc_pasti.mod; M1.3 change 21,
* docs/m13-plan.md) added to TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0).
* OTCGEN reaches only the CAP terms with GROWTH, TIMES-NZ the CAP terms with GROWTH and SYNC;
* this case reaches the four families and every term type:
* - GRW_HYD (EQE_UCRSU, REG1 and REG2): hydro capacity grows by at most 2% a year (4% from
*   2030) plus a constant; GROWTH on the RHS CAP term, the past investments of ELCREHYD00
*   subtracted in the first period (uc_pasti.mod); UC_TIME in REG2 (the LEAD(T) factor of
*   equserco.mod L118).
* - GRW_NUC (EQE_UCSU, summed over REG1 and REG2): new nuclear capacity, GROWTH on NCAP.
* - SYN_GAS (EQE_UCRSU, REG1): gas-plant activity against coal-plant activity in the same
*   period (SYNC on the RHS ACT term, so ppmain.mod L1168 adds the N attribute and the N
*   entry of UC_TMAP is left out) and the coal plant's electricity output in the previous
*   period (the RHS FLO term without attributes, the N entry).
* - GRW_ELCTS (EQE_UCRSUS, REG1, slice WD): electricity production (COMPRD) by slice,
*   GROWTH on the RHS COMPRD term.
* - GRW_IMP (EQE_UCSUS, summed over REG1, ANNUAL): coal imports (IRE) with GROWTH, against
*   the net coal production (COMNET) of the previous period.
* The constants are loose, so the model stays feasible.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET UC_N
/
GRW_HYD 'Growth of hydro capacity'
GRW_NUC 'Growth of nuclear investment'
SYN_GAS 'Gas activity against coal'
GRW_ELCTS 'Growth of electricity production by slice'
GRW_IMP 'Growth of coal imports'
/

SET UC_R_EACH
/
REG1.GRW_HYD
REG2.GRW_HYD
REG1.SYN_GAS
REG1.GRW_ELCTS
/

SET UC_R_SUM
/
REG1.GRW_NUC
REG2.GRW_NUC
REG1.GRW_IMP
/

SET UC_ATTR
/
REG1.GRW_HYD.RHS.CAP.GROWTH
REG2.GRW_HYD.RHS.CAP.GROWTH
REG1.GRW_NUC.RHS.NCAP.GROWTH
REG2.GRW_NUC.RHS.NCAP.GROWTH
REG1.SYN_GAS.RHS.ACT.SYNC
REG1.GRW_ELCTS.RHS.COMPRD.GROWTH
REG1.GRW_IMP.RHS.IRE.GROWTH
/

PARAMETER
UC_CAP ' '/
GRW_HYD.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCREHYD00 1
GRW_HYD.LHS.REG2.2005.ELCREHYD00 1
GRW_HYD.RHS.REG1.2005.ELCREHYD00 1.02
GRW_HYD.RHS.REG1.2030.ELCREHYD00 1.04
GRW_HYD.RHS.REG2.2005.ELCREHYD00 1.02
/

PARAMETER
UC_NCAP ' '/
GRW_NUC.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCNNNUC01 1
GRW_NUC.LHS.REG2.2005.ELCNNNUC01 1
GRW_NUC.RHS.REG1.2005.ELCNNNUC01 1.1
GRW_NUC.RHS.REG2.2005.ELCNNNUC01 1.05
/

PARAMETER
UC_ACT ' '/
SYN_GAS.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCTEGAS00.ANNUAL 1
SYN_GAS.RHS.REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.ANNUAL 2
/

PARAMETER
UC_FLO ' '/
SYN_GAS.RHS.REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.ELC.ANNUAL 0.5
/

PARAMETER
UC_COMPRD ' '/
GRW_ELCTS.LHS.REG1.2005.ELC.WD 1
GRW_ELCTS.RHS.REG1.2005.ELC.WD 1.03
/

PARAMETER
UC_IRE ' '/
GRW_IMP.LHS.REG1.2005.MINCOA1.COA.ANNUAL.IMP 1
GRW_IMP.RHS.REG1.2005.MINCOA1.COA.ANNUAL.IMP 1.1
/

PARAMETER
UC_COMNET ' '/
GRW_IMP.RHS.REG1.2005.COA.ANNUAL 0.01
/

PARAMETER
UC_TIME ' '/
GRW_HYD.REG2.2005 0.1
GRW_HYD.REG2.2050 0.3
/

PARAMETER
UC_RHSRT ' '/
REG1.GRW_HYD.0.UP 5
REG1.GRW_HYD.2005.UP 5
REG2.GRW_HYD.0.UP 5
REG2.GRW_HYD.2005.UP 8
REG1.SYN_GAS.0.UP 5
REG1.SYN_GAS.2005.UP 1000
/

PARAMETER
UC_RHSRTS ' '/
REG1.GRW_ELCTS.0.WD.UP 5
REG1.GRW_ELCTS.2005.WD.UP 200
/

PARAMETER
UC_RHST ' '/
GRW_NUC.0.UP 5
GRW_NUC.2005.UP 50
/

PARAMETER
UC_RHSTS ' '/
GRW_IMP.0.ANNUAL.UP 5
GRW_IMP.2005.ANNUAL.UP 2000
/
